!!! oculus/window/viewport.mat
!!! Configurable viewport with scaling support.
!!!
!!! The viewport defines the active rendering area in both logical and
!!! physical dimensions. Scaling is the ratio between logical and physical
!!! units, enabling HiDPI/Retina displays without changing scene logic.

book oculus.window.viewport

read everything from ny.lang.core

public viewport begin record
    field physical-width as override long
    field physical-height as override long
    field logical-width as override long
    field logical-height as override long
    field scale-x as floating
    field scale-y as floating
end record
